  "title": "Easy Cinnamon Roll Casserole",
  "description": "This cinnamon roll casserole is made with store-bought cinnamon rolls, pecans, and maple syrup; the packaged frosting is a decadent dessert or brunch item.",
  "authors": [
    "savta"
